{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>One who gives to the poor</b> — lacks nothing, for HaShem will fill his needs, as in the matter of \"He who lends to YHWH is he who shows grace to the poor.\"" "<b>And hides his eyes</b> — from the poor, many curses are upon him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra quotes Proverbs 19:17 in full as the cross-reference.", 1 "The phrase רוב מארות (\"many curses\") is rendered hyper-literally; the syntax is elliptical, with no explicit subject or copula."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:19.166646601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}